From: 77450danik <ddziuba1@stu.vistula.edu.pl>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 10:44:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] user32: SwitchToThisWindow makes the window the
 foreground one.

The taskbar switches windows with it: the window came to the top but
stayed inactive, with a grey title.
---
 dlls/user32/win.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/user32/win.c b/dlls/user32/win.c
index bcf88ee2..1c938198 100644
--- a/dlls/user32/win.c
+++ b/dlls/user32/win.c
@@ -635,8 +635,9 @@ UINT WINAPI GetDpiForWindow( HWND hwnd )
  */
 void WINAPI SwitchToThisWindow( HWND hwnd, BOOL alt_tab )
 {
+    /* as in Windows, the window becomes the foreground one, not only the top one */
     if (IsIconic( hwnd )) NtUserShowWindow( hwnd, SW_RESTORE );
-    else BringWindowToTop( hwnd );
+    NtUserSetForegroundWindow( hwnd );
 }
 
 
